 #            docs/INSTALL.md section 19.A) or, as the reference/alternative, on Windows outside Docker
 #            (scripts/Start-NexoraIntelligence.ps1, section 19.B). Intelligence is on an INTERNAL network; only
 #            intelligence-edge reaches the host (Ollama) and publishes the report request API on 127.0.0.1.
+#   Stage 7  Nexora Frontend, the web console (profile "frontend": service frontend, published on 127.0.0.1 only;
+#            docs/12-docker.md of the Nexora-front-end repository). Needs the client nexora-console in Keycloak.
 #
 # Nothing here is specific to one company: the enterprise source, the inference server and the identity provider are
